  "title": "Experience at a moment is a property of the present physical state",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "0ae542a0-595d-4d63-8bf2-67aa7a15441f",
      "text": "What is experienced at a moment is a property of the physical state, or event, at that moment. The frameworks that say so name different states: a topological pocket of a field, an orchestrated quantum reduction, the tones of a mesh at one beat, or whatever present property a theory identifies.",
